B.LA=new A.fn("All times are worked out on your phone from the positions of the sun and moon \u2014 no internet needed. Moon: Meeus, Astronomical Algorithms. Sun: NOAA solar equations. Moonrise and moonset follow the US Naval Observatory definition (upper edge of the moon on the horizon). Town names: GeoNames (geonames.org), CC BY 4.0. Your location stays on this device.",null,null)
B.LB=new A.fn("Major periods are when the moon is overhead or underfoot (\xb11 hour); Minor periods are moonrise and moonset (\xb130 minutes). This is the classic solunar theory of John Alden Knight (1926), worked out from the sun and moon for your spot. It is a guide, not a guarantee \u2014 weather, water temperature and air pressure matter too.",null,null)
