B.LC=new A.fn("Shooting hours are set by each state and differ by species and season. Many states allow big game from 30 minutes before sunrise to 30 minutes after sunset; federal rules for ducks and geese usually end at sunset. Always check your state\u2019s current regulations \u2014 this app only does the math.",B.QP,null)
